12:46.059 --> 12:50.939
I don't wanna go to my room.
There's an evil monkey in my closet.

12:51.066 --> 12:54.276
Evil monkey! That's funny.

12:57.196 --> 12:58.364
Agh!

13:00.033 --> 13:02.953
This romantic dinner
