- As we agreed.

17:09.459 --> 17:11.543
Admirable. But foolish!

17:14.756 --> 17:18.301
It's going to be a shame
to destroy such a worthy adversary.

17:18.426 --> 17:20.511
My thoughts exactly.

17:31.856 --> 17:34.984
- I've got you in the sleeper hold.
- As I you.

17:35.401 --> 17:37.821
Your attempts to escape are...

17:37.904 --> 17:40.114
Futile.

17:54.380 --> 17:57.091
Well, well. Nap time appears to be over.

17:57.091 --> 18:03.055
